tic-campfires", "project_type": "mod", "team": "lu6EXSiP", "organization": null, "title": "Realistic Campfires", "description": "Change how the vanilla campfire works by requiring you to put more work in creating and maintaining a campfire", "body": "# Realistic Campfires\n\n![fabric-api](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg)\n![neoforge](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg)\n\n[![Use SHADOWHUNTER30 to get 30% off your first server with NeyHost!](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/08986aac2bbc07a1b205ce147eb5a9fc26ac0e7e_0.webp)](https://www.neyhost.com/?ref=SHADOWHUNTER30)\n\n_I only recommend products that I use myself.  Are you looking for a budget-friendly and reliable hosting provider?  Try out Ney Host with my code `SHADOWHUNTER30` and get 30% off your first purchase!  I am happy with their services which is why I recommend you to check them out!_\n\n## Info\n\nChange how the vanilla campfire works by requiring you to put more work in creating and maintaining a campfire.\n\n## Features\n\nWhenever you place down a campfire, it will not be lit.  In order to light it on fire, you need to do the following things:\n\n- `Right click` a campfire while holding a log in your main hand.\n- Grab a flint and steel and light the fire.  This will instantly light the fire.  By default, using four (4) sticks will also light the fire.  By default, the fire will last for five (5) minutes.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> These properties of the mod can be customized via a datapack.  See the [docs](https://docs.shadowhunter22.dev/mods/realistic-campfires/) for more information.\n\nOther features include:\n\n- A custom campfire model that indicates a log has been dropped onto the campfire\n- `Shift + right click` to get the log back (note: you need to do so with an empty hand!)\n- Break the campfire and get the log back.\n\nOther features include:\n\n- Rain will extinguish the campfire\n- Water, if one block above the campfire, will extinguish the campfire\n\nThese features apply to both the campfire and soul campfire blocks.\n\nThere are also custom textures for the different logs you drop onto the campfire instead being the default oak log.\n\n## Versions\n\nThis mod is available for the following Minecraft versions:\n\n`1.20.x`\n\n`1.21.x`\n\n`26.1`\n`26.1.1`\n`26.1.2`\n`26.2`\n`26.3-snapshot`\n\n## Client and Server Support\n\nThis mod is *required* to be added to both the client and server for this mod to work properly.", "body_url": null, "published": "2024-01-31T01:07:42.973204Z", "updated": "2026-09-24T19:37:23.869778Z", "approved": "2024-02-10T07:45:57.499951Z", "queued": "2024-01-31T01:27:44.354940Z", "status": "approved", "requested_status": "approved", "moderator_message": null, "license": {"id": "LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved", "name": "", "url": null}, "downloads": 86982, "followers": 79, "categories": ["adventure", "decoration", "game-mechanics"], "additional_categories": [], "loaders": ["fabric", "neoforge"], "versions": ["fNSKWENE", "dFn7ySkV", "WYA1WF25", "bsatgb5K", "EZmz2pd7", "h6ThdG3L", "27X3akIk", "uuQRZGER", "rdhbTy5t", "tqR67Nqt", "5IaEMBGY", "CZ6MDVgv", "j13RvCvz", "HATINdfc", "4R44Qump", "958vCkDc", "qwKqJj7I", "kbxe8Dak", "JDyZlfvT", "hbZUTrSk", "wBHVp1aN", "zzst6SsQ", "Eh32pjSS", "ISmzNPWB", "1s8pAequ", "Ek0dzbmt", "Qgc6G2lI", "UMF8MnF3", "yaVRa584", "mOcelerL", "w3wRThQj", "lLARLOv0", "tZTOmDz4", "DzDmW0VM", "xa8mISQh", "8WF0iMpO", "XvmEDMiD", "6hxZB4Hy", "d6FSKUtn", "FjxOBqWF", "ZtwGw3FY", "G8BRpSbB", "yDAnH9jT", "yY1CqboP", "5FsGw6iz", "AEuDApTQ", "b6QKHVDt", "zWJJ8qLO", "mUkidhpw", "QOrPkMPQ", "iHIYSsOi", "brGhKXny", "SVAlKjs7", "P0OYOSTg", "OGrBxhSW", "7w4Vd1j9", "ygN1CeJo", "jvAYjRRD", "Zxr6XBCO", "kp4KVYue", "utOy5mTH", "fP8mo52F"], "icon_url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ZEMQmiVU/e6bd19f8b0ec6c0a8cebb0557cc3837b81c000fc.png", "raw_icon_url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ZEMQmiVU/e6bd19f