for the appreciation.\n\n![Schematics](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bf9279ed29c310a439a6a23e9b159918a8b4a744.png)\n\n\n##  NEW STRUCTURES\n\n- Cherry Grove Village\n- Swamp Village\n\nI have included brand new structures to minecraft! For now I have included the Cherry Grove Village and Swamp village, but with time I will add more villages (Meadow and Jungle).\nThe Cherry Village can be found with the command /locate structures vsrevamped:village_cherry.\nThe Swamp Village can be found with the command /locate structures vsrevamped:village_swamp\n![Cherry Village](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/08142ac891500a9b2d7e1d673c515db9c69aaa10.png)\n\n![Swamp Village](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6271f245dab2a84ada212ece5f49d0f0ae614bab.jpeg)\n\n## COMPLETELY REPLACED STRUCTURES\n\nThese structures are completely replaced so you can find them with the /locate command or sites such as chunkbase.com\n\n- Plains Village\n- Savanna Village\n- Desert Village\n- Taiga Village\n- Snowy Village\n- Pillager Outpost\n\n\n## PARTIALLY REPLACED STRUCTURES\n\nThese structure can be found with the help of sites such as chunkbase. All vanilla structures are replaced with my custom ones. However the /locate command will sometimes teleport you to the nearest \"non vanilla\" structure. These buildings are hardcoded into minecraft so I can't replace only their normal spawns.\n\n**DISCLAIMER!!** Strongholds can't always be found with sites such as chunkbase. They can still be found with the /locate command and with Eyes of Ender. I have also made them rarer but infinite (vanilla minecraft is limited to 128 strongholds).\n\n- Desert Pyramid\n- End cities\n- Jungle Pyramid\n- Swamp Hut\n- Strongholds\n\n\n\n\nWhen I update my datapack you can delete the old datapack and install the new one. Every new village will be generated with the updated datapack.\n\nIf you want to use only the villages from this datapack, check out my other datapack [Villages Revamped.](https://modrinth.com/datapack/villages-revamped)", "body_url": null, "published": "2024-08-18T14:34:33.223258Z", "updated": "2026-09-24T19:57:18.405007Z", "approved": "2024-08-19T01:26:26.886736Z", "queued": "2024-08-18T17:01:11.292829Z", "status": "approved", "requested_status": "approved", "moderator_message": null, "license": {"id": "LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved", "name": "", "url": null}, "downloads": 104989, "followers": 497, "categories": ["adventure", "decoration", "worldgen"], "additional_categories": [], "loaders": ["datapack", "fabric", "forge", "neoforge"], "versions": ["vSJPbdpD", "1BsUQP0w", "9i6zo2Nr", "DY8yEJLW", "WbDbjxmy", "139gI6T3", "9By4UTrr", "Se4Tqlxe", "5ZuGxBGg", "4RuB6lyb", "Z4fAV2Yc", "rDch2W7h", "lpXuErtc", "dSSkqMl4", "RKQ4QQY1", "mjHSojUv", "wo2Nh7kw", "l8MDtvTj", "wjhl96GQ", "38O3piEp", "PZT1bd3B", "p9AB4oNm", "d8UeLKhF", "zTXmkLiD", "ySLTQ0sj", "n8ArfF1A", "uv8zrQwB", "d7oecEE7"], "icon_url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/q3gDW66d/fddd24171271ac77badbbb50668d8cea5b2b4f97_96.webp", "raw_icon_url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/q3gDW66d/9c827d8f7a78e3eb8bb8a072a2df1bd049ff2cff.png", "issues_url": "https://github.com/brutusmaxi/Vanilla-Structure-Update/issues", "source_url": null, "wiki_url": null, "discord_url": null, "donation_urls": [], "gallery": [{"url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/q3gDW66d/images/0a2c80924ae9d480e7d5eec41c17d3bebe4ffc0d_350.webp", "raw_url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/q3gDW66d/images/0a2c80924ae9d480e7d5eec41c17d3bebe4ffc0d.png", "featured": false, "title": "Pillager Outpost", "description": null, "created": "2024-08-18T16:53:19.554961Z", "ordering": 0}, {"url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/q3gDW66d/images/28b6b10dffde4ebedfce5044ce749fd254b9d765_350.webp", "raw_url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/q3gDW66d/images/36b5d30cece5b2b3666404a42178130a6fa8fc38.png", "featured": true, "title": "Taiga Village", "description": null, "created": "2024-08-18T16:58:38.953466Z", "ordering": 0}, {"url": "https:/