f generally improving the designs and quality control, Redux also has many things that Craftemon just didn't have before, like properly labeled Legendaries, Mythicals, and Paradoxes, mountable Craftemon, and TM movesets! You can even find Alpha Craftemon, normally in the same spawning area as their regulars! \n\nThis is not a one-and-done thing. Not only do I want to give this a few more updates myself, but I also want to let the community be involved with the future of this addon, the same way I gave them free rein to submit their own mons and changes to Craftemon Retro. Thank you all for downloading the slapped-together little addon I made 2 years ago, and I hope you enjoy this new, less slapped-together addon just as much.", "body_url": null, "published": "2026-09-20T15:51:32.905562Z", "updated": "2026-09-24T19:55:31.648714Z", "approved": "2026-09-23T20:54:03.973326Z", "queued": "2026-09-22T09:48:19.512160Z", "status": "approved", "requested_status": "approved", "moderator_message": null, "license": {"id": "LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved", "name": "", "url": null}, "downloads": 63, "followers": 4, "categories": ["adventure", "mobs", "themed"], "additional_categories": ["16x", "entities", "models"], "loaders": ["datapack", "fabric", "forge", "minecraft", "neoforge"], "versions": ["9zt2O0Wn", "PfnRa9Rk", "u3MclGBh"], "icon_url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Sug0f6kT/eaead4e56b25e93397f38e1f14c3f2eb923a36aa.png", "raw_icon_url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Sug0f6kT/eaead4e56b25e93397f38e1f14c3f2eb923a36aa.png", "issues_url": null, "source_url": null, "wiki_url": null, "discord_url": "https://discord.gg/D4XUP63Mz7", "donation_urls": [], "gallery": [{"url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Sug0f6kT/images/0b5231be81f9424be817adb3d48042be840737bc.png", "raw_url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Sug0f6kT/images/0b5231be81f9424be817adb3d48042be840737bc.png", "featured": false, "title": "Allaive", "description": "The Allay Pok\u00e9mon.\nFound uncommonly near Villages a